  "title": {
   "en": "Ginmaku Romance ~Shiitagerare Kazoku Reijou ga Reikoku Danna-sama no Saiai ni Naru made~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "銀幕ロマンス ～虐げられ華族令嬢が冷酷旦那様の最愛になるまで～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I became the wife of a national star... Chitose Ooe, the daughter of a noble family, endured daily comparisons to her accomplished sister-in-law and brother, suffering under her family’s cruelty. One day, obeying her parents’ orders, she married Koichiro Katsuki, the infamous heir of a viscount family known as a 'good-for-nothing.' But on her wedding day, the groom who appeared was none other than Hoshiai Koichiro — the dazzling silver screen star of the era! A Taisho-era Cinderella love story between a kind-hearted noblewoman and an icy screen star!"
  },
